  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued support to the land reform in Latvia. The support will consist of expert advice within the following areas: Legislative support, Cadastre and land registration, Multi purpose LIS, National cadastre maps, Mass valuation for taxation and finally Organization and management.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fortsatt st&#xf6;d till den lettiska landreformen. Svensk expertis fr&#xe5;n Swedesurvey st&#xf6;der State Land Service of Latvia med att bygga upp en fungerande och modern lantm&#xe4;terimyndighet, kapabel att hantera den information som finns tillg&#xe4;nglig i register, ortofotokartor m.m.</narrative>
  </description>
